"If enabled, the system will allow negative stock entries for the batch. "
"But, this may lead to incorrect valuation rates, so it is recommended to "
"avoid using this option. The system will permit negative stock only when "
"it is caused by backdated entries and will validate and block negative "
"stock in all other cases."
msgstr "如果启用，系统将允许该批次出现负库存。但这可能导致计价错误，因此建议避免使用此选项。系统仅在由倒填单据引起的情况下允许负库存，在其他所有情况下都会验证并拦截负库存。"

