msgid ""
"ERPNext will make a stock ledger entry for each transaction of this item."
" Keep unchecked for non-stock or service items."
msgstr "ERPNext 将为此物料的每笔交易生成物料凭证条目。对于非库存或服务类物料，请保持未勾选状态。"

msgid ""
"Enable for raw material items used in BOM. Uncheck for additional "
"services like 'washing' used in manufacturing."
msgstr "为 BOM 中使用的原材料物料启用。对于制造中使用的附加服务（如\"清洗\"），请取消勾选。"

msgid ""
"Used to create an opening Stock Entry with the Valuation Rate when the "
"item is saved"
msgstr "用于创建新物料时同步生成期初库存（其它入库）。"

msgid "Creates an Item Price automatically when the item is saved"
msgstr "在保存物料时自动创建物料价格。"

msgid "Enable if this item is a company asset like machinery or furniture."
msgstr "如果该物料是公司资产（如机器或家具），请启用。"

msgid ""
"Percentage by which over-delivery or over-receipt is allowed against a "
"Sales/Purchase Order for this item. If not set, value from Stock Settings"
" will be used."
msgstr "针对该物料的销售/采购订单允许的超额出库/入库百分比。如果未设置，将使用库存设置中的值。"

msgid ""
"Percentage by which over-billing is allowed against a Sales/Purchase "
"Order for this item. If not set, value from Accounts Settings will be "
"used."
msgstr "针对该物料的销售/采购订单允许的超额开票百分比。如果未设置，将使用会计设置中的值。"

msgid ""
"Creates a single grouped asset instead of individual assets when "
"purchased in bulk."
msgstr "批量采购时创建一个分组资产，而不是单个资产。"

msgid ""
"Allow stock to go below zero for this item, even if negative stock is "
"disabled in Stock Settings."
msgstr "允许负库存（库存数量低于零），即使在库存设置中禁用了负库存。"

msgid ""
"Allow substituting this item with an alternative from the Item "
"Alternative list when stock is unavailable."
msgstr "当库存不可用时，允许使用物料替代列表中的替代品替换该物料。"

msgid ""
"Enable if a vendor manufactures this item for you. You can choose to "
"provide them raw materials using the default BOM."
msgstr "如果供应商为您制造该物料，请启用。您可以选择使用默认 BOM 为其提供原材料。"

msgid ""
"Enable for drop shipping - supplier delivers directly to the customer "
"without passing through your warehouse."
msgstr "如果是直运（直接代发）启用 - 供应商直接交付给客户，不经过您的仓库。"

msgid ""
"Track each unit with a unique serial number for warranty and return "
"tracking. Cannot be changed after a stock transaction exists."
msgstr "用唯一序列号跟踪每个单位，以便保修和退货跟踪。存在库存交易后无法更改。"

msgid ""
"Track this item in batches. Cannot be changed after a stock transaction "
"exists."
msgstr "按批次跟踪该物料。存在库存交易后无法更改。"

msgid ""
"Defines the date after which the item can no longer be used in "
"transactions or manufacturing"
msgstr "定义该物料不能再用于交易或制造的日期之后。"

msgid ""
"Expense for this item will be recognized over a period of months. Eg: "
"prepaid insurance or annual software license"
msgstr "该物料的费用将在数月内确认。例如：预付保险或年度软件许可证。"

msgid ""
"Income from this item will be recognized over a period of months instead "
"of all at once. Eg: annual subscription paid upfront."
msgstr "该物料的收入将在数月内确认，而不是一次性全部确认。例如：提前支付的年度订阅费。"

msgid ""
"Enable to reserve a small sample from each batch for any analysis arising"
" ahead"
msgstr "启用以为每批保留少量样本，用于未来可能出现的任何分析。"

msgid ""
"If enabled, sales from this item will be included in Sales Person and "
"Sales Partner commission calculations"
msgstr "如果启用，该物料的销售将包含在销售人员和销售合作伙伴的佣金计算中。"

msgid ""
"Batch number will be auto-created in format AAAA.00001 if not specified "
"in transactions. Leave blank to always enter batch numbers manually."
msgstr "如果交易中未指定，批号将按格式 AAAA.00001 自动创建。留空表示始终手动输入批号。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Maximum discount % allowed when selling this item. Eg: if set to 20%, a "
"discount greater than 20% cannot be applied in sales transactions."
msgstr "销售该物料时允许的最大折扣百分比。例如：若设置为 20%，则销售交易中不能应用超过 20% 的折扣。"

msgid "Disabled items cannot be selected in any transaction."
msgstr "禁用的物料无法在任何交易中被选择。"

msgid "Will also apply for variants unless overridden"
msgstr "除非被覆盖，否则也将应用于多规格物料。"

msgid ""
"Batch number will be created based on expiry date. Expiry dates can be "
"set in the Batch master."
msgstr "批号将根据到期日期创建。到期日期可以在批次主数据中设置。"

msgid ""
"Enable if this item is provided by a customer and received via Stock "
"Entry."
msgstr "如果该物料由客户提供并通过其它入库接收，请启用。"

msgid ""
"Minimum stock level to maintain as a buffer. Used to calculate "
"recommended reorder level: Reorder Level = Safety Stock + (Average Daily "
"Consumption × Lead Time)."
msgstr "作为缓冲维持的最低库存水平。用于计算建议的再订货点：再订货点 = 安全库存 +（平均每日消耗量 × 提前期）。"

msgid ""
"The rate at which this item was last purchased via a Purchase Invoice. "
"Auto-updated by the system."
msgstr "该物料最后一次采购发票单价。由系统自动更新。"

msgid ""
"A quality inspection must be completed before generating a Purchase "
"Receipt for this item."
msgstr "此物料采购入库前，必须提交质量单。"

msgid ""
"A quality inspection must be completed before generating a Delivery Note "
"for this item."
msgstr "此物料销售出库提交前，必须提交质检单。"

