"If enabled, the item rate won't adjust to the valuation rate during "
"internal transfers, but accounting will still use the valuation rate. "
"This will allow the user to specify a different rate for printing or "
"taxation purposes."
msgstr "如果启用，会计记账仍使用成本价。用户维护的物料价用于打印与报税。"

msgid ""
"If enabled, the system will allow negative stock entries for this batch, "
"overriding the 'Allow negative stock for Batch' setting in Stock "
"Settings. This may lead to incorrect valuation rates, so it is "
"recommended to avoid using this option."
msgstr "如果启用，系统将允许该批次的负库存条目，覆盖库存设置中的“允许批次的负库存”设置。这可能会导致不正确的估值率，因此建议避免使用此选项。"

