#, python-format
msgid ""
"<h5>Message Example</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<pre>&lt;h3&gt;Order Overdue&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n"
"\r\n"
"&lt;p&gt;Transaction {{ doc.name }} has exceeded Due Date. Please take "
"necessary action.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n"
"\r\n"
"&lt;!-- show last comment --&gt;\r\n"
"{% if comments %}\r\n"
"Last comment: {{ comments[-1].comment }} by {{ comments[-1].by }}\r\n"
"{% endif %}\r\n"
"\r\n"
"&lt;h4&gt;Details&lt;/h4&gt;\r\n"
"\r\n"
"&lt;ul&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;li&gt;Customer: {{ doc.customer }}\r\n"
"&lt;li&gt;Amount: {{ doc.grand_total }}\r\n"
"&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n"
"</pre>"
msgstr ""
"<h5>消息范例</h5>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<pre>&lt;h3&gt;订单逾期&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n"
"\r\n"
"&lt;p&gt;交易 {{ doc.name }} 已逾期. 请采取必要行动.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n"
"\r\n"
"&lt;!-- 显示最新备注信息 --&gt;\r\n"
"{% if comments %}\r\n"
"最新备注: {{ comments[-1].comment }}  {{ comments[-1].by }}\r\n"
"{% endif %}\r\n"
"\r\n"
"&lt;h4&gt;详情&lt;/h4&gt;\r\n"
"\r\n"
"&lt;ul&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;li&gt;客户: {{ doc.customer }}\r\n"
"&lt;li&gt;金额: {{ doc.grand_total }}\r\n"
"&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n"
"</pre>"

msgid ""
"Track if your email has been opened by the recipient.\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"Note: If you're sending to multiple recipients, even if 1 recipient reads"
" the email, it'll be considered \"Opened\""
msgstr ""
"追踪收件人是否打开邮件.\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"注: 如发给多人,其中一个打开邮件都会被标记为\"打开过\""

msgid "Grievance"
msgstr "申诉"

msgid ""
"Only values between [0,1) are allowed. Like {0.00, 0.04, 0.09, ...}\r\n"
"Ex: If allowance is set at 0.07, accounts that have balance of 0.07 in "
"either of the currencies will be considered as zero balance account"
msgstr ""
"限0到1之间，如0.04，0.09\r\n"
"举例 尾差限额0.07，本币或外币余额小于0.07时被视为余额为0"

msgid ""
"Configure how amended documents will be named.<br>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Default behaviour is to follow an amend counter which adds a number to "
"the end of the original name indicating the amended version. <br>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Default Naming will make the amended document to behave same as new "
"documents."
msgstr ""
"设置修订后单据编号规则\r\n"
"默认规则是在被修订单据编号基础上添加修订次数(版本)后缀\r\n"
"选择默认单据编号规则时修订后的单据会重新生成下一个新单据编号"

msgid ""
"If enabled, do not update serial / batch values in the stock transactions"
" on creation of auto Serial \r\n"
" / Batch Bundle. "
msgstr "如勾选，物料移动相关单据自动创建序列号/批号时不同步明细行的序列号与批号字段"

msgid ""
"If <b>Enabled</b> - Reconciliation happens on the <b>Advance Payment "
"posting date</b><br>\r\n"
"If <b>Disabled</b> - Reconciliation happens on oldest of 2 Dates: "
"<b>Invoice Date</b> or the <b>Advance Payment posting date</b><br>\r\n"
msgstr ""
"如果 <b>勾选</b> - 基于 <b>预付款记账日</b>核销<br>\r\n"
"如果 <b>不勾选</b> - 基于: <b>发票日</b> 或 <b>预付款记账时</b>两者中最晚日期核销<br>"

msgid ""
"System will do an implicit conversion using the pegged currency. <br>\r\n"
"Ex: Instead of AED -&gt; INR, system will do AED -&gt; USD -&gt; INR "
"using the pegged exchange rate of AED against USD."
msgstr ""
"系统将采用挂钩货币进行隐式汇率转换。\r\n"
"例如：系统不会直接转换AED→INR，而是基于AED与美元的挂钩汇率，通过AED→USD→INR的路径完成间接换算。"

msgid ""
"0 - too guessable: risky password.\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"1 - very guessable: protection from throttled online attacks. \r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"2 - somewhat guessable: protection from unthrottled online attacks.\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"3 - safely unguessable: moderate protection from offline slow-hash "
"scenario.\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"4 - very unguessable: strong protection from offline slow-hash scenario."
msgstr ""
"0 - 太容易猜到：有风险的密码。\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"1 - 非常容易猜测：防止受到限制的在线攻击。 \r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"2 - 有点可猜测：防止不受限制的在线攻击。\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"3 - 安全地不可猜测：适度保护免受离线慢哈希场景的影响。\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
"4 - 非常难以猜测：针对离线慢哈希场景的强大保护。"

msgid ""
"1 Currency = [?] Fraction\r\n"
"For e.g. 1 USD = 100 Cent"
msgstr ""
"1货币 = [？]分\r\n"
"例如1美元 = 100 美分"

msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/framework/user/en/api/rest#1-token-"
"based-authentication\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n"
"  Click here to learn about token-based authentication\r\n"
"</a>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/framework/user/en/api/rest#1-token-"
"based-authentication\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n"
"  点击此处了解基于令牌的认证\r\n"
"</a>"

msgid ""
"<div class=\"well\">\r\n"
"    Edit list of Series in the box. Rules:\r\n"
"    <ul>\r\n"
"        <li>Each Series Prefix on a new line.</li>\r\n"
"        <li>Allowed special characters are \"/\" and \"-\"</li>\r\n"
"        <li>\r\n"
"            Optionally, set the number of digits in the series using dot "
"(.)\r\n"
"            followed by hashes (#). For example, \".####\" means that the"
" series\r\n"
"            will have four digits. Default is five digits.\r\n"
"        </li>\r\n"
"        <li>\r\n"
"            You can also use variables in the series name by putting them"
"\r\n"
"            between (.) dots\r\n"
"            <br>\r\n"
"            Supported Variables:\r\n"
"            <ul>\r\n"
"                <li><code>.YYYY.</code> - Year in 4 digits</li>\r\n"
"                <li><code>.YY.</code> - Year in 2 digits</li>\r\n"
"                <li><code>.MM.</code> - Month</li>\r\n"
"                <li><code>.DD.</code> - Day of month</li>\r\n"
"                <li><code>.WW.</code> - Week of the year</li>\r\n"
"                <li>\r\n"
"                    <code>.{fieldname}.</code> - fieldname on the "
"document e.g.\r\n"
"                    <code>branch</code>\r\n"
"                </li>\r\n"
"                <li><code>.FY.</code> - Fiscal Year (requires ERPNext to "
"be installed)</li>\r\n"
"                <li><code>.ABBR.</code> - Company Abbreviation (requires "
"ERPNext to be installed)</li>\r\n"
"            </ul>\r\n"
"        </li>\r\n"
"    </ul>\r\n"
"    Examples:\r\n"
"    <ul>\r\n"
"        <li>INV-</li>\r\n"
"        <li>INV-10-</li>\r\n"
"        <li>INVK-</li>\r\n"
"        <li>INV-.YYYY.-.{branch}.-.MM.-.####</li>\r\n"
"    </ul>\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"
msgstr ""
"<div class=\"well\">\r\n"
"    在框中编辑系列列表。规则：\r\n"
"    <ul>\r\n"
"        <li>每个系列前缀占一行。</li>\r\n"
"        <li>允许的特殊字符为“/”和“-”</li>\r\n"
"        <li>\r\n"
"            可选地，使用点 (.)\r\n"
"            后跟井号 (#) 来设置系列中的位数。例如，“.####”表示系列\r\n"
"            将有四位数字。默认值为五位数字。\r\n"
"        </li>\r\n"
"        <li>\r\n"
"            您还可以在系列名称中使用变量，方法是将它们放在\r\n"
"            (.) 点之间\r\n"
"            <br>\r\n"
"            支持的变量：\r\n"
"            <ul>\r\n"
"                <li><code>.YYYY。</code> - 4 位数字的年份</li>\r\n"
"                <li><code>.YY。</code> - 2 位数字的年份</li>\r\n"
"                <li><code>.MM.</code> - 月份</li>\r\n"
"                <li><code>.DD.</code> - 月份中的日期</li>\r\n"
"                <li><code>.WW.</code> - 一年中的周数</li>\r\n"
"                <li><code>.FY.</code> - 财政年度</li>\r\n"
"                <li><code>.ABBR.</code> - 公司缩写</li>\r\n"
"                <li>\r\n"
"                    <code>.{fieldname}.</code> - 文档上的字段名称，例如\r\n"
"                    <code>分支</code>\r\n"
"                </li>\r\n"
"            </ul>\r\n"
"        </li>\r\n"
"    </ul>\r\n"
"    示例：\r\n"
"    <ul>\r\n"
"        <li>INV-</li>\r\n"
"        <li>INV-10-</li>\r\n"
"        <li>INVK-</li>\r\n"
"        <li>INV-.YYYY.-.{branch}.-.MM.-.####</li>\r\n"
"    </ul>\r\n"
"</div>\r\n"
"<br>\r\n"

msgid ""
"<h3>Custom CSS Help</h3>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>Notes:</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li>All field groups (label + value) are set attributes <code>data-"
"fieldtype</code> and <code>data-fieldname</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>All values are given class <code>value</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>All Section Breaks are given class <code>section-break</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>All Column Breaks are given class <code>column-break</code></li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Examples</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>1. Left align integers</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<pre><code>[data-fieldtype=\"Int\"] .value { text-align: left; "
"}</code></pre>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>1. Add border to sections except the last section</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<pre><code>.section-break { padding: 30px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid "
"#eee; }\r\n"
".section-break:last-child { padding-bottom: 0px; border-bottom: 0px;  "
"}</code></pre>\r\n"
msgstr ""
"<h3>自定义 CSS 帮助</h3>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>注释：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li>所有字段组（标签 + 值）都设置了属性<code>data-fieldtype</code>和<code>data-"
"fieldname</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>所有值都有类<code>value</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>所有分段断开均使用<code>section-break</code>类</li>\r\n"
"<li>所有分隔列均为<code>column-break</code>类</li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>1.左对齐整数</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<pre><code>[data-fieldtype=\"Int\"] .value { text-align: left; "
"}</code></pre>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>1.为除最后一节外的各节添加边框</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<pre><code>.section-break { padding：30px 0px; border-bottom：1px solid "
"#eee; }\r\n"
".section-break:last-child { padding-bottom：0px; border-bottom：0px; "
"}</code></pre>\r\n"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"<h3>Print Format Help</h3>\r\n"
"<hr>\r\n"
"<h4>Introduction</h4>\r\n"
"<p>Print Formats are rendered on the server side using the Jinja "
"Templating Language. All forms have access to the <code>doc</code> object"
" which contains information about the document that is being formatted. "
"You can also access common utilities via the <code>frappe</code> "
"module.</p>\r\n"
"<p>For styling, the Boostrap CSS framework is provided and you can enjoy "
"the full range of classes.</p>\r\n"
"<hr>\r\n"
"<h4>References</h4>\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"\t<li><a href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/templates/\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Jinja Templating Language</a></li>\r\n"
"\t<li><a href=\"http://getbootstrap.com\" target=\"_blank\">Bootstrap CSS"
" Framework</a></li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"<hr>\r\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\r\n"
"<pre><code>&lt;h3&gt;{{ doc.select_print_heading or \"Invoice\" "
"}}&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;div class=\"row\"&gt;\r\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-3 text-right\"&gt;Customer Name&lt;/div&gt;\r\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-9\"&gt;{{ doc.customer_name }}&lt;/div&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/div&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;div class=\"row\"&gt;\r\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-3 text-right\"&gt;Date&lt;/div&gt;\r\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-9\"&gt;{{ doc.get_formatted(\"invoice_date\") "
"}}&lt;/div&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/div&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;table class=\"table table-bordered\"&gt;\r\n"
"\t&lt;tbody&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th&gt;Sr&lt;/th&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th&gt;Item Name&lt;/th&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th&gt;Description&lt;/th&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th class=\"text-right\"&gt;Qty&lt;/th&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th class=\"text-right\"&gt;Rate&lt;/th&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th class=\"text-right\"&gt;Amount&lt;/th&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t{%- for row in doc.items -%}\r\n"
"\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 3%;\"&gt;{{ row.idx }}&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 20%;\"&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t\t{{ row.item_name }}\r\n"
"\t\t\t\t{% if row.item_code != row.item_name -%}\r\n"
"\t\t\t\t&lt;br&gt;Item Code: {{ row.item_code}}\r\n"
"\t\t\t\t{%- endif %}\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 37%;\"&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t\t&lt;div style=\"border: 0px;\"&gt;{{ row.description "
"}}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 10%; text-align: right;\"&gt;{{ row.qty }} {{"
" row.uom or row.stock_uom }}&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 15%; text-align: right;\"&gt;{{\r\n"
"\t\t\t\trow.get_formatted(\"rate\", doc) }}&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 15%; text-align: right;\"&gt;{{\r\n"
"\t\t\t\trow.get_formatted(\"amount\", doc) }}&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t{%- endfor -%}\r\n"
"\t&lt;/tbody&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/table&gt;</code></pre>\r\n"
"<hr>\r\n"
"<h4>Common Functions</h4>\r\n"
"<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n"
"\t<tbody>\r\n"
"\t\t<tr>\r\n"
"\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 30%;\"><code>doc.get_formatted(\"[fieldname]\", "
"[parent_doc])</code></td>\r\n"
"\t\t\t<td>Get document value formatted as Date, Currency, etc. Pass "
"parent <code>doc</code> for currency type fields.</td>\r\n"
"\t\t</tr>\r\n"
"\t\t<tr>\r\n"
"\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 30%;\"><code>frappe.db.get_value(\"[doctype]\", "
"\"[name]\", \"fieldname\")</code></td>\r\n"
"\t\t\t<td>Get value from another document.</td>\r\n"
"\t\t</tr>\r\n"
"\t</tbody>\r\n"
"</table>\r\n"
msgstr ""
"<h3>打印格式帮助</h3>\r\n"
"<hr>\r\n"
"<h4>简介</h4>\r\n"
"<p>打印格式是使用 Jinja "
"模板语言在服务器端渲染的。所有表单都可以访问<code>doc</code>对象，该对象包含正在格式化的文档的相关信息。你还可以通过<code>frappe</code>模块访问常用工具。</p>"
"\r\n"
"<p>在样式设计方面，我们提供了 Boostrap CSS 框架，你可以使用全部的类。</p>\r\n"
"<hr>\r\n"
"<h4>参考资料</h4>\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"\t<li><a href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/templates/\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Jinja 模板语言</a></li>\r\n"
"\t<li><a href=\"http://getbootstrap.com\" target=\"_blank\">Bootstrap CSS"
" 框架</a></li>\r\n"
"</ol>\r\n"
"<hr>\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<pre><code>&lt;h3&gt;{{ doc.select_print_heading or \"Invoice\" "
"}}&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;div class=\"row\"&gt;\r\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-3 text-right\"&gt;客户姓名&lt;/div&gt;\r\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-9\"&gt;{{ doc.customer_name }}&lt;/div&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/div&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;div class=\"row\"&gt;\r\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-3 text-right\"&gt;Date&lt;/div&gt;\r\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-9\"&gt;{{ doc.get_formatted(\"invoice_date\") "
"}}&lt;/div&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/div&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;table class=\"table table- border\" trbodybordered\"&gt;\r\n"
"\t&lt;tbody&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th&gt;Sr&lt;/th&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th&gt;Item Name&lt;/th&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th&gt;Description&lt;/th&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th class=\"text- right\" Qty /th th class=\"text- right\" "
"Qtyright\"&gt;Qty&lt;/th&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th class=\"text-right\"&gt;Rate&lt;/th&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th class=\"text-right\"&gt;Amount&lt;/th&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t{%- for row in doc.items -%}\r\n"
"\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width：3%;\"&gt;{{ row.idx }}&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 20%;\"&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t\t{{ row.item_name }}\r\n"
"\t\t\t\t{% if row.item_code != row.item_name -%}\r\n"
"\t\t\t\t&lt;br&gt;项目代码： {{ row.item_code}}\r\n"
"\t\t\t\t{%- endif %}\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 37%;\"&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t\t&lt;div style=\"border：0px;\"&gt;{{ row.description "
"}}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 10%; text-align: right;\"&gt;{{ row.qty }} {{"
" row.uom or row.stock_uom }}&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 15%; text-align: right;\"&gt;{{\r\n"
"\t\t\t\trow.get_formatted(\"rate\", doc) }}&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 15%; text-align: right;\"&gt;{{\r\n"
"\t\t\t\trow.get_formatted(\"amount\", doc) }}&lt;/td&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n"
"\t\t{%- endfor -%}\r\n"
"\t&lt;/tbody&gt;\r\n"
"&lt;/table&gt;</code></pre>\r\n"
"<hr>\r\n"
"<h4>常用函数</h4>\r\n"
"<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n"
"\t<tbody>\r\n"
"\t\t<tr>\r\n"
"\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 30%;\"><code>doc.get_formatted(\"[fieldname]\", "
"[parent_doc])</code></td>\r\n"
"\t\t\t<td>获取格式为日期、货币等的文档值。对于货币类型字段，请传递父<code>doc</code>。</td>\r\n"
"\t\t</tr>\r\n"
"\t\t<tr>\r\n"
"\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 30%;\"><code>frappe.db.get_value(\"[doctype]\", "
"\"[name]\", \"fieldname\")</code></td>\r\n"
