msgid ""
"<p>Multiple webforms can be created for a single doctype. Add filters "
"specific to this webform to display correct record after "
"submission.</p><p>For Example:</p>\r\n"
"<p>If you create a separate webform every year to capture feedback from "
"employees add a \r\n"
" field named year in doctype and add a filter <b>year = 2023</b></p>\r\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>可为单一类型创建多个网络表单。为该网络表单添加特定筛选器，以便在提交后显示正确的记录。</p><p>例如</p>\r\n"
"<p>如果您每年都创建一个单独的网络表格来收集员工的反馈意见，请在 doctype 中添加一个名为年份的 \r\n"
" 字段，并添加过滤器<b>年份 = 2023</b></p>\r\n"

msgid ""
"<p>Set context before rendering a template. Example:</p><p>\r\n"
"</p><div><pre><code>\r\n"
"context.project = frappe.get_doc(\"Project\", frappe.form_dict.name)\r\n"
"</code></pre></div>"
msgstr ""
"<p>在渲染模板前设置上下文。示例</p><p>\r\n"
"</p><div><pre><code>\r\n"
"context.project = frappe.get_doc(\"Project\", frappe.form_dict.name)\r\n"
"</code></pre></div>"

msgid ""
"<p>To interact with above HTML you will have to use `root_element` as a "
"parent selector.</p><p>For example:</p><pre class=\"p-3 bg-gray-100 "
"border-radius rounded-sm mb-0\" style=\"width: fit-content;\"><code>// "
"here root_element is provided by default\r\n"
"let some_class_element = root_element.querySelector('.some-class');\r\n"
"some_class_element.textContent = \"New content\";\r\n"
"</code></pre>"
msgstr ""
"<p>要与上述 HTML 交互，您必须使用 `root_element` 作为父选择器。</p><p>例如：</p><pre "
"class=\"p-3 bg-gray-100 border-radius rounded-sm mb-0\" style=\"width: "
"fit-content;\"><code>// 这里默认提供 root_element\r\n"
"let some_class_element = root_element.querySelector('.some-class');\r\n"
