"</code></pre>"

msgid ""
"<pre>*  *  *  *  *\r\n"
"┬  ┬  ┬  ┬  ┬\r\n"
"│  │  │  │  │\r\n"
"│  │  │  │  └ day of week (0 - 6) (0 is Sunday)\r\n"
"│  │  │  └───── month (1 - 12)\r\n"
"│  │  └────────── day of month (1 - 31)\r\n"
