"Items table will not change its price. It will get reset to the price "
"based on its Child Items on saving the doc."
msgstr ""
"启用此功能将执行以下操作：\r\n"
"<ul style=\"padding-left:16px\">\r\n"
"<li>Make the rate column of all Packed/Bundle Items tables editable.</li>"
"\r\n"
"<li> 根据“套件物料明细”表中指定的子物料的价格，计算“物料”表中所有 <a href=\"/desk/product-bundle\" "
"rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> 产品套件 </a> 的价格。 </li>\r\n"
"</ul>\r\n"
"注意：如果启用此功能，则更新“物料”表中的“产品套装”的费率不会更改其价格。保存文档时，它将根据其子物料重置为价格。"

msgid ""
