msgid ""
"<h3>Help</h3>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>Notes:</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li>Use field <code>base</code> for using base salary of the "
"Employee</li>\r\n"
"<li>Use Salary Component abbreviations in conditions and formulas. "
"<code>BS = Basic Salary</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>Use field name for employee details in conditions and formulas. "
"<code>Employment Type = employment_type</code><code>Branch = "
"branch</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>Use field name from Salary Slip in conditions and formulas. "
"<code>Payment Days = payment_days</code><code>Leave without pay = "
"leave_without_pay</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>Direct Amount can also be entered based on Condition. See example "
"3</li></ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>Examples</h4>\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li>Calculating Basic Salary based on <code>base</code>\r\n"
"<pre><code>Condition: base &lt; 10000</code></pre>\r\n"
"<pre><code>Formula: base * .2</code></pre></li>\r\n"
"<li>Calculating HRA based on Basic Salary<code>BS</code> \r\n"
"<pre><code>Condition: BS &gt; 2000</code></pre>\r\n"
"<pre><code>Formula: BS * .1</code></pre></li>\r\n"
"<li>Calculating TDS based on Employment Type<code>employment_type</code>"
" \r\n"
"<pre><code>Condition: employment_type==\"Intern\"</code></pre>\r\n"
"<pre><code>Amount: 1000</code></pre></li>\r\n"
"</ol>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>帮助</h3>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<p>注释：</p>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li>用字段 <code>base</code> 表示员工基本工资</li>\r\n"
"<li>在条件和公式中使用工资组成部分的缩写。 <code>BS = Basic Salary</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>在条件和公式中使用字段名称来显示员工详细信息。 <code>就业类型 = employment_type</code><code>分部 ="
" branch</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>在条件和公式中使用工资单中的字段名称。 <code>账期 = payment_days</code><code>无薪假期 = "
"leave_without_pay</code></li>\r\n"
"<li>也可以根据条件输入具体金额。参见示例 3</li></ol>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<h4>示例</h4>\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li>根据 <code>base</code> 计算基本工资\r\n"
"<pre><code>条件：base &lt; 10000</code></pre>\r\n"
"<pre><code>公式：base * .2</code></pre></li>\r\n"
"<li>计算 HRA 基本工资 <code>BS</code>\r\n"
"<pre><code>条件：BS &gt; 2000</code></pre>\r\n"
"<pre><code>公式：BS * .1</code></pre></li>\r\n"
"<li>计算基于 TDS 的员工类型 <code>employment_type</code> \r\n"
"<pre><code>条件：employment_type==\"实习\"</code></pre>\r\n"
"<pre><code>金额：1000</code></pre></li>\r\n"
"</ol>"

msgid ""
"<h4>Condition Examples</h4>\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li>Applying tax if employee born between 31-12-1937 and 01-01-1958 "
"(Employees aged 60 to 80)<br>\r\n"
"<code>Condition: date_of_birth&gt;date(1937, 12, 31) and "
"date_of_birth&lt;date(1958, 01, 01)</code></li><br><li>Applying tax by "
"employee gender<br>\r\n"
"<code>Condition: gender==\"Male\"</code></li><br>\r\n"
"<li>Applying tax by Salary Component<br>\r\n"
"<code>Condition: base &gt; 10000</code></li></ol>"
msgstr ""
"<h4>条件示例</h4>\r\n"
"<ol>\r\n"
"<li>如果员工出生在 1937 年 12 月 31 日至 1958 年 1 月 1 日之间（员工年龄在 60 岁至 80 "
"岁之间），则需纳税<br>\r\n"
"<code>条件：date_of_birth&gt;date(1937, 12, 31) and "
"date_of_birth&lt;date(1958, 01, 01)</code></li><br><li>按员工性别算税<br>\r\n"
"<code>条件：gender==\"男\"</code></li><br>\r\n"
"<li>按工资组成算税<br>\r\n"
"<code>条件：base &gt; 10000</code></li></ol>"

msgid ""
