"Save the tasks you repeat on every job, and start the next project from "
"them."
msgstr "把每次都要重复的任务存起来，下一个项目可直接套用。"

msgid "Reuse it as a template"
msgstr "作为模板复用"

msgid "Open Delayed Tasks Summary"
msgstr "打开延期任务汇总"

msgid "Tasks past their due date, and how late each one is."
msgstr "已过截止日期的任务，以及各延误多久。"

msgid "Spot delayed tasks"
msgstr "发现延期任务"

msgid "Open Warehouse"
msgstr "打开仓库"

msgid ""
"We created a few to start with. Rename them, or add the places you "
"actually keep stock. See "
"[Warehouse](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/warehouse)."
msgstr "我们已预置了几个仓库。你可以重命名，或按实际存放位置新增。参见[仓库](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/warehouse)。"

msgid "Review your warehouses"
msgstr "检查你的仓库"

msgid ""
"Stock goes up in the warehouse you receive into, and the bill can be made"
" from the receipt. See [Purchase "
"Receipt](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/purchase-receipt)."
msgstr ""
"收货进入哪个仓库，库存就增加在哪里，账单也可由收货单生成。参见[采购入库](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/purchase-receipt)。"

msgid "Receive goods from a supplier"
msgstr "从供应商收货"

msgid "Open Stock Ledger"
msgstr "打开库存明细账"

msgid ""
"Every movement of every item, in and out, with the balance after each. "
"See [Stock Ledger](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/stock-"
"ledger)."
msgstr ""
"每一种物料的每一次进出，以及每次变动后的余额。参见[库存明细账](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/stock-ledger)。"

msgid "Follow every movement"
msgstr "跟踪每一次出入库"

msgid ""
"From the store to the shop floor, or between branches. See [Stock "
"Entry](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/stock-entry)."
msgstr ""
"从库房到车间，或在各分仓之间调拨。参见[物料移动](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/stock-entry)。"

msgid "Move stock between warehouses"
msgstr "在仓库之间调拨库存"

msgid "Create Stock Reconciliation"
msgstr "创建库存盘点调整"

msgid ""
"How much of each item is on your shelves, and what it is worth. From "
"here, every receipt and delivery keeps it up to date. See [Stock "
"Reconciliation](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/stock-"
"reconciliation)."
msgstr ""
"每种物料在货架上有多少、值多少钱。此后每次收货和发货都会自动更新。参见[库存盘点调整](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/stock-reconciliation)。"

msgid "Enter the stock you have today"
msgstr "录入当前实际库存"

msgid ""
"Stock goes down as the goods leave, and the invoice can be made from the "
"delivery. See [Delivery "
"Note](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/delivery-note)."
msgstr ""
"发货后库存减少，发票也可由发货单生成。参见[销售出库](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/delivery-note)。"

msgid "Ship to a customer"
msgstr "发货给客户"

msgid "Open Stock Balance"
msgstr "打开库存余额"

msgid "What you have in each warehouse, and what it is worth."
msgstr "各仓库现有库存的数量与金额。"

msgid "Check your stock levels"
msgstr "检查库存水平"

msgid ""
"Anything you keep on shelves and count. See "
"[Item](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/item)."
msgstr "任何放在货架上需要清点的东西。参见[物料](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/item)。"

msgid "Add an item you stock"
msgstr "添加你库存的物料"

msgid "Open Buying"
msgstr "打开采购"

msgid "Add a supplier, order from them and pay their bill."
msgstr "添加供应商，向其下单并支付账单。"

msgid "Add User"
msgstr "添加用户"

msgid "Add the people you work with and choose what they can see."
msgstr "把一起工作的同事加进来，并设置他们能看的内容。"

msgid "Invite your team"
msgstr "邀请你的团队"

msgid "Break a project into tasks and log the time your team spends."
msgstr "把项目拆成任务，并记录团队投入的工时。"

msgid "Open Assets"
msgstr "打开资产"

msgid "Record an asset and see what it's worth year by year."
msgstr "登记一项资产，并查看它逐年还剩多少价值。"

msgid "Open Stock"
msgstr "打开库存"

msgid "Set up your warehouses and enter the stock you have today."
msgstr "设置好仓库，并录入当前实际库存。"

msgid "Open Quality"
msgstr "打开质量"

msgid "Set up an inspection and record your first check."
msgstr "设置检查项并记录第一次检查结果。"

msgid "Open Selling"
msgstr "打开销售"

msgid "Add an item and a customer, bill them and collect the payment."
msgstr "添加物料和客户，向其开票并收回款项。"

msgid "Open Accounts"
msgstr "打开会计"

msgid "Check your chart of accounts and taxes, and add the bank account you use."
msgstr "检查科目表和税率，并添加你常用的银行账户。"

msgid "Open Manufacturing"
msgstr "打开生产"

msgid "Write down what goes into a product and make it with a work order."
msgstr "记下产品的用料，并用生产工单把它做出来。"

msgid "Create Asset Movement"
msgstr "创建资产移动"

msgid ""
"Record who has it and where it is, so you always know. See [Asset "
"Movement](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/asset-movement)."
msgstr ""
"记录由谁使用、放在何处，随时都能查到。参见[资产移动](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/asset-movement)。"

msgid "Hand it to a person or place"
msgstr "交给某人或移到某处"

msgid ""
"Computers, vehicles, furniture: how each kind depreciates, and which "
"accounts it posts to. See [Asset "
"Category](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/asset-category)."
msgstr ""
"电脑、车辆、家具：各类资产的折旧方式，以及计入哪些科目。参见[资产类别](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/asset-category)。"

msgid "Set up an asset category"
msgstr "设置资产类别"

msgid "Create Asset Maintenance"
msgstr "创建资产维护"

msgid ""
"Servicing, inspections and calibration, with reminders to the team doing "
"it. See [Asset Maintenance](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/asset-maintenance)."
msgstr ""
"保养、巡检和校准，并提醒负责的同事。参见[资产维护](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/asset-maintenance)。"

msgid "Schedule its upkeep"
msgstr "安排保养计划"

msgid "Open Fixed Asset Register"
msgstr "打开固定资产台账"

msgid "What you own, where it is, and what it is worth today."
msgstr "你拥有什么、放在哪里、现在值多少钱。"

msgid "See everything you own"
msgstr "查看拥有的全部资产"

msgid ""
"The kind of thing you own, marked as a fixed asset. See "
"[Item](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/item)."
msgstr "你拥有的、标记为固定资产的物品类别。参见[物料](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/item)。"

msgid "Add an asset item"
msgstr "添加一项资产物料"

msgid "Add Asset"
msgstr "添加资产"

msgid ""
"Something you bought before using ERPNext, with what you paid, where it "
"is, and how much has already depreciated. See "
"[Asset](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/asset)."
msgstr ""
"使用 ERPNext "
"之前就已购入的东西，记录买价、位置和已计提折旧。参见[资产](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/asset)。"

msgid "Record an asset you already own"
msgstr "登记已有的资产"

msgid "Open Asset Depreciation Ledger"
msgstr "打开资产折旧明细"

msgid ""
"Depreciation is posted on schedule, asset by asset, without a journal "
"entry from you. See "
"[Depreciation](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/asset-"
"depreciation)."
msgstr ""
"折旧按计划逐项自动计提，无需你手工做凭证。参见[折旧](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/asset-depreciation)。"

msgid "Check its depreciation"
msgstr "查看折旧情况"

msgid "Open Chart of Accounts"
msgstr "打开科目表"

msgid ""
"We set up a standard chart of accounts for your country. See how your "
"accounts are grouped, and rename or add any to match how you report. See "
"[Chart of Accounts](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/chart-"
"of-accounts)."
msgstr ""
"我们已按你所在国家预置了标准科目表。看看科目如何分组，并按你的报表口径重命名或新增。参见[科目表](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/chart-of-accounts)。"

msgid "Review your chart of accounts"
msgstr "检查你的科目表"

msgid "Open Balance Sheet"
msgstr "打开资产负债表"

msgid ""
"Assets, liabilities and equity on any date, straight from your ledger. "
"See [Balance Sheet](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/balance-sheet)."
msgstr ""
"任一日期的资产、负债和权益，直接来自你的账簿。参见[资产负债表](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/balance-sheet)。"

msgid "Know what you own and owe"
msgstr "了解你拥有和欠付的"

msgid "Open Sales Taxes and Charges Template"
msgstr "打开销售税费模板"

msgid ""
"The taxes that fill in on every invoice. We added your country's where we"
" had them; check the rates match what you charge. Purchase taxes live in "
"[Purchase Taxes and Charges Template](/desk/purchase-taxes-and-charges-"
"template). See [Setting Up "
"Taxes](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/setting-up-taxes)."
msgstr ""
"每张发票自动带出的税。我们已尽可能加入你所在国家的税种，请核对税率是否与实际一致。采购税在[采购税费模板](/desk/purchase-"
"taxes-and-charges-"
"template)中设置。参见[设置税](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/setting-up-taxes)。"

msgid "Review your taxes"
msgstr "检查你的税率"

msgid "Add Bank Account"
msgstr "添加银行账户"

msgid ""
"The account your customers pay into and you pay from, linked to its "
"account in your chart of accounts. See [Bank "
"Account](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/bank-account)."
msgstr ""
"客户打款进来、你对外付款使用的账户，并与科目表中的科目关联。参见[银行户头](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/bank-account)。"

msgid "Add the bank account you use"
msgstr "添加你使用的银行账户"

msgid "Open Banking"
msgstr "打开银行"

msgid ""
"Import a statement from your bank and pair each line with a payment, so "
"your books agree with it. See [Bank "
"Reconciliation](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/bank-"
"reconciliation)."
msgstr ""
"导入银行对账单，把每一行与收付款核对，使账面与银行一致。参见[银行对账](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/bank-reconciliation)。"

msgid "Match your bank statement"
msgstr "核对银行对账单"

msgid ""
"For anything that isn't an invoice or a payment: accruals, depreciation, "
"or fixing a mistake. See [Journal "
"Entry](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/journal-entry)."
msgstr ""
"用于发票和收付款之外的业务：计提、折旧或更正错误。参见[日记账凭证](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/journal-entry)。"

msgid "Post a journal entry"
msgstr "录入一张日记账凭证"

msgid "Open Profit and Loss"
msgstr "打开利润表"

msgid ""
"Income against expenses for any period, built from every invoice and "
"payment you have recorded."
msgstr "任一期间的收入与费用，由你已录入的全部发票和收付款汇总而成。"

msgid "Check your profit"
msgstr "查看利润情况"

msgid "Open General Ledger"
msgstr "打开会计总账"

msgid ""
"Every posting from your invoices and payments, with its debit and credit."
" See [General Ledger](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/general-ledger)."
msgstr ""
"发票和收付款产生的每一笔分录，及其借贷金额。参见[会计总账](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/general-ledger)。"

msgid "Trace every posting"
msgstr "追溯每一笔分录"

msgid ""
"It posts the expense, and what you owe the supplier, to your ledger. See "
"[Purchase Invoice](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/purchase-invoice)."
msgstr ""
"它把费用和对供应商的欠款记入账簿。参见[采购发票](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/purchase-invoice)。"

msgid "Enter a supplier's bill"
msgstr "录入供应商账单"

msgid "Create Quality Inspection Template"
msgstr "创建质检模板"

msgid ""
"The parameters to inspect and what counts as a pass, reused on every "
"inspection. See [Quality Inspection "
"Template](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/quality-"
"inspection-template)."
msgstr ""
"需要检查的参数和合格标准，可在每次检查时复用。参见[质检模板](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/quality-inspection-template)。"

msgid "Decide what to check"
msgstr "确定检查内容"

msgid "Create Quality Inspection"
msgstr "创建质检单"

msgid ""
"Record the results against a receipt or a delivery, and accept or reject "
"the goods. See [Quality "
"Inspection](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/quality-"
"inspection)."
msgstr ""
"针对收货或发货记录检查结果，并判定接收或拒收。参见[质检单](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/quality-inspection)。"

msgid "Inspect goods coming in or going out"
msgstr "检查进出货物"

msgid "Create Quality Review"
msgstr "创建质量评审"

msgid ""
"Compare the results against the goal, and decide what to change. See "
"[Quality Management](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/quality-management)."
msgstr ""
"把结果与目标对比，并决定要改进什么。参见[质量管理](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/quality-management)。"

msgid "Review how a goal is going"
msgstr "评审目标进展"

msgid "Create Non Conformance"
msgstr "创建不合格报告单"

msgid ""
"When something falls short of the procedure, note what happened, the "
"cause, and what you will do about it. See [Non "
"Conformance](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/non-"
"conformance)."
msgstr ""
"未达到流程要求时，记录发生了什么、原因及处理措施。参见[不合格报告单](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/non-conformance)。"

msgid "Log a problem"
msgstr "记录一个问题"

msgid "Create Quality Goal"
msgstr "创建质量目标"

msgid ""
"Something you want to measure and improve, like on-time delivery or "
"returns, reviewed on a schedule you choose. See [Quality "
"Management](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/quality-"
"management)."
msgstr ""
"你想衡量并改进的指标，例如按时交货率或退货率，按你设定的周期评审。参见[质量管理](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/quality-management)。"

msgid "Set a quality goal"
msgstr "设定质量目标"

msgid "Create Maintenance Schedule"
msgstr "创建维护巡修计划"

msgid ""
"Regular service visits for equipment you sold, planned ahead for the "
"whole contract. See [Maintenance "
"Schedule](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/maintenance-"
"schedule)."
msgstr ""
"为售出的设备安排定期上门服务，按合同期统一规划。参见[维护巡修计划](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/maintenance-schedule)。"

msgid "Plan maintenance visits"
msgstr "安排巡修计划"

msgid "Create Quality Procedure"
msgstr "创建质量流程"

msgid ""
"The steps your team follows, so it is done the same way every time. See "
"[Quality Management](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/quality-management)."
msgstr ""
"团队遵循的步骤，保证每次做法一致。参见[质量管理](https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/quality-management)。"

msgid "Write down how the work is done"
msgstr "把做法写下来"

