msgid ""
"If enabled, formula for <b>Required Qty</b>: <br>\n"
"Required Qty (BOM) - <a "
"href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/projected-"
"quantity\">Projected Qty</a>. <br> This helps avoid over-ordering."
msgstr ""
"启用后，<b>所需数量</b>的计算公式为：<br>\n"
"所需数量（BOM） - <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/projected-quantity\">预计数量</a>。<br> 有助于避免超量订购。"

msgid "Raw Material Group Warehouse"
msgstr "原材料组仓库"

msgid ""
"Optional group warehouse. Raw material availability is checked across its"
