msgstr "可选的组仓库。原材料可用量会在其下级仓库中检查；物料仍收入“目标仓库”。"

msgid ""
"If enabled, formula for <b>Qty to Order</b>: <br>\n"
"Required Qty (BOM) - <a "
"href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/projected-"
"quantity\">Projected Qty</a>. <br> This helps avoid over-ordering."
msgstr ""
"启用后，<b>需订购数量</b>的计算公式为：<br>\n"
"所需数量（BOM） - <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en"
"/projected-quantity\">预计数量</a>。<br> 有助于避免超量订购。"

msgid "Task Progress"
msgstr "任务进度"

msgid ""
"Partial stock can be reserved. For example, If you have a Sales Order of "
"100 units and the Available Stock is 90 units then a Stock Reservation "
"Entry will be created for 90 units."
msgstr "可以部分预留库存。例如销售订单为 100 件而可用库存为 90 件时，系统会为 90 件创建库存预留分录。"

msgid ""
"If enabled, do not update serial / batch values in the stock transactions"
" on creation of auto Serial \n"
" / Batch Bundle."
msgstr "如勾选，自动创建序列号/批号捆绑包时，不会更新库存业务中的序列号/批号值。"

msgid ""
"Simple Python formula applied on Reading fields.<br> Numeric eg. 1: "
"<b>reading_1 &gt; 0.2 and reading_1 &lt; 0.5</b><br>\n"
"Numeric eg. 2: <b>mean &gt; 3.5</b> (mean of populated fields)<br>\n"
"Value based eg.:  <b>reading_value in (\"A\", \"B\", \"C\")</b>"
msgstr ""
"应用于读数字段的简单 Python 公式。<br> 数值示例 1：<b>reading_1 &gt; 0.2 and reading_1 &lt;"
" 0.5</b><br>\n"
"数值示例 2：<b>mean &gt; 3.5</b>（已填字段的平均值）<br>\n"
"取值示例：<b>reading_value in (\"A\", \"B\", \"C\")</b>"

msgid "Finished Good Quantity"
msgstr "成品数量"

msgid "Adjustment Entry"
msgstr "调整分录"

msgid ""
"Per Day\n"
"Shift Time (In Hours) * No of Workstations * No of Shift"
msgstr ""
"每天\n"
"班次时长（小时）* 工作站数量 * 班次数"

msgid ""
"Example: ABCD.#####\n"
"If series is set and Serial No is not mentioned in transactions, then "
"automatic serial number will be created based on this series. If you "
"always want to explicitly mention Serial Nos for this item. leave this "
"blank."
msgstr ""
"示例：ABCD.#####\n"
"如果设置了序列且单据中未填写序列号，将按此序列自动生成序列号。如果你总是希望为物料明确填写序列号，请留空。"

msgid "Minimum quantity should be as per Stock UOM"
msgstr "最小数量应以库存单位为基准"

msgid ""
"If <b>Enabled</b> - Reconciliation happens on the <b>Advance Payment "
"posting date</b><br>\n"
"If <b>Disabled</b> - Reconciliation happens on oldest of 2 Dates: "
"<b>Invoice Date</b> or the <b>Advance Payment posting date</b><br>"
msgstr ""
"若<b>启用</b>：在<b>预付款记账日期</b>进行核销<br>\n"
"若<b>禁用</b>：在<b>发票日期</b>或<b>预付款记账日期</b>两者中较早的日期核销<br>"

msgid "Default Work In Progress Warehouse"
msgstr "默认在制品仓库"

