"Each row maps a field on a Single (Settings) doctype to surface for this "
"doctype."
msgstr "每行将单条（设置）单据类型上的一个字段映射为对该单据类型展示。"

msgid ""
"0 - too guessable: risky password.\n"
"<br>\n"
"1 - very guessable: protection from throttled online attacks. \n"
"<br>\n"
"2 - somewhat guessable: protection from unthrottled online attacks.\n"
"<br>\n"
"3 - safely unguessable: moderate protection from offline slow-hash "
"scenario.\n"
"<br>\n"
"4 - very unguessable: strong protection from offline slow-hash scenario."
msgstr ""
"0 - 极易猜到：密码不安全。\n"
"<br>\n"
"1 - 很容易猜到：可抵御限速的在线攻击。\n"
"<br>\n"
"2 - 较容易猜到：可抵御不限速的在线攻击。\n"
"<br>\n"
"3 - 难以猜到：对离线慢哈希场景有中等防护。\n"
"<br>\n"
"4 - 极难猜到：对离线慢哈希场景有强防护。"

msgid "OTP placeholder should be defined as <code>{{ otp }}</code>"
msgstr "一次性密码占位符应写为 <code>{{ otp }}</code>"

