msgstr "插入或更新记录"

msgid ""
"<pre>*  *  *  *  *\n"
"┬  ┬  ┬  ┬  ┬\n"
"│  │  │  │  │\n"
"│  │  │  │  └ day of week (0 - 6) (0 is Sunday)\n"
"│  │  │  └───── month (1 - 12)\n"
"│  │  └────────── day of month (1 - 31)\n"
"│  └─────────────── hour (0 - 23)\n"
"└──────────────────── minute (0 - 59)\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"* - Any value\n"
"/ - Step values\n"
"</pre>"
msgstr ""
"<pre>*  *  *  *  *\n"
"┬  ┬  ┬  ┬  ┬\n"
"│  │  │  │  │\n"
"│  │  │  │  └ 星期几 (0 - 6)（0 为周日）\n"
"│  │  │  └───── 月份 (1 - 12)\n"
"│  │  └────────── 日期 (1 - 31)\n"
"│  └─────────────── 小时 (0 - 23)\n"
"└──────────────────── 分钟 (0 - 59)\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"* - 任意值\n"
"/ - 步长\n"
"</pre>"

msgid ""
"Send this notification's content from an Email Template instead of "
"Subject/Message. Also used for the bell if Send System Notification is "
"checked. The template is looked up fresh on every send, so editing it "
"later changes what gets sent here too."
msgstr "从邮件模板发送此通知的内容，而不是使用主题/正文。若勾选“发送系统通知”，铃铛也使用该模板。每次发送时都会重新读取模板，因此之后修改模板也会改变此处发送的内容。"

msgid ""
"Track if your email has been opened by the recipient.\n"
"<br>\n"
"Note: If you're sending to multiple recipients, even if 1 recipient reads"
" the email, it'll be considered \"Opened\""
msgstr ""
"跟踪收件人是否打开了你的邮件。\n"
"<br>\n"
"注意：若同时发送给多个收件人，只要有 1 位收件人阅读，即视为“已打开”"

msgid ""
"Naming Options:\n"
"<ol><li><b>field:[fieldname]</b> - By Field</li><li><b>naming_series:</b>"
" - By Naming Series (field called naming_series must be "
"present)</li><li><b>Prompt</b> - Prompt user for a "
"name</li><li><b>[series]</b> - Series by prefix (separated by a dot); for"
" example PRE.#####</li>\n"
"<li><b>format:EXAMPLE-{MM}morewords{fieldname1}-{fieldname2}-{#####}</b> "
"- Replace all braced words (fieldnames, date words (DD, MM, YY), series) "
"with their value. Outside braces, any characters can be used.</li></ol>"
msgstr ""
"命名选项：\n"
"<ol><li><b>field:[fieldname]</b> - 按字段</li><li><b>naming_series:</b> - "
"按命名序列（必须存在名为 naming_series 的字段）</li><li><b>Prompt</b> - "
"提示用户输入名称</li><li><b>[series]</b> - 带前缀的序列（以点分隔），例如 PRE.#####</li>\n"
"<li><b>format:EXAMPLE-{MM}morewords{fieldname1}-{fieldname2}-{#####}</b> "
"- 将大括号中的内容（字段名、日期词（DD、MM、YY）、序列）替换为对应值。大括号之外可使用任意字符。</li></ol>"

msgid ""
"This field will appear only if the fieldname defined here has value OR "
"the rules are true (examples):\n"
"myfield\n"
"eval:doc.myfield=='My Value'\n"
"eval:doc.age&gt;18"
msgstr ""
"仅当此处定义的字段名有值或规则成立时，该字段才会显示（示例）：\n"
"myfield\n"
"eval:doc.myfield=='My Value'\n"
"eval:doc.age&gt;18"

msgid ""
"To add dynamic values from the document, use jinja tags like\n"
"\n"
"<div>\n"
"<pre><code>{ \"id\": \"{{ doc.name }}\" }</code>\n"
"</pre>\n"
"</div>"
msgstr ""
"如需从单据中获取动态值，可使用如下 jinja 标签\n"
"\n"
"<div>\n"
"<pre><code>{ \"id\": \"{{ doc.name }}\" }</code>\n"
"</pre>\n"
"</div>"

msgid ""
"URIs for receiving authorization code once the user allows access, as "
"well as failure responses. Typically a REST endpoint exposed by the "
"Client App.\n"
"<br>e.g. "
"http://hostname/api/method/frappe.integrations.oauth2_logins.login_via_facebook"
msgstr ""
"用户授权后用于接收授权码以及接收失败响应的 URI。通常是客户端应用提供的 REST 接口。\n"
"<br>例如 "
"http://hostname/api/method/frappe.integrations.oauth2_logins.login_via_facebook"

msgid ""
"Unique ID assigned by the client developer used to identify the client "
"software to be dynamically registered.\n"
"<br>\n"
"<b>Should remain same</b> across multiple versions or updates of the "
"software."
msgstr ""
"由客户端开发者分配的、用于动态注册时标识客户端软件的唯一 ID。\n"
"<br>\n"
"<b>必须保持不变</b>，即使软件有多个版本或更新。"

msgid ""
"A version identifier string for the client software.\n"
"<br>\n"
"The value of the should change on any update of the client software with "
"the same Software ID."
msgstr ""
"客户端软件的版本标识字符串。\n"
"<br>\n"
"同一软件 ID 的客户端软件更新时，该值应随之变化。"

msgid ""
"The Client ID obtained from the Google Cloud Console under <a "
"href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials\">\n"
"\"APIs &amp; Services\" &gt; \"Credentials\"\n"
"</a>"
msgstr ""
"在 Google Cloud Console 的 <a "
"href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials\">\n"
"“API 和服务” &gt; “凭据”\n"
"</a> 中获取的客户端 ID"

msgid ""
"The browser API key obtained from the Google Cloud Console under <a "
"href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials\">\n"
"\"APIs &amp; Services\" &gt; \"Credentials\"\n"
"</a>"
msgstr ""
"在 Google Cloud Console 的 <a "
"href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials\">\n"
"“API 和服务” &gt; “凭据”\n"
"</a> 中获取的浏览器 API 密钥"

msgid ""
"The project number obtained from Google Cloud Console under <a "
"href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com/iam-admin/settings\">\n"
"\"IAM &amp; Admin\" &gt; \"Settings\"\n"
"</a>"
msgstr ""
"在 Google Cloud Console 的 <a href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com/iam-"
"admin/settings\">\n"
"“IAM 和管理” &gt; “设置”\n"
"</a> 中获取的项目编号"

msgid ""
"New line separated list of allowed public client URLs (eg "
"<code>https://frappe.io</code>), or <code>*</code> to accept all.\n"
"<br>\n"
"Public clients are restricted by default."
msgstr ""
"允许的公共客户端 URL 列表，以换行分隔（例如 <code>https://frappe.io</code>），或使用 "
"<code>*</code> 接受全部。\n"
"<br>\n"
"默认情况下公共客户端受限。"

msgid ""
"1 Currency = [?] Fraction\n"
"For e.g. 1 USD = 100 Cent"
msgstr ""
"1 货币 = [?] 辅币单位\n"
"例如 1 USD = 100 Cent"

msgid "A person you deal with, at a customer, supplier or anywhere else."
msgstr "与你往来的个人，可能是客户、供应商或其他方面的人员。"

msgid "A postal address of a customer, supplier, company or contact."
msgstr "客户、供应商、公司或联系人的通讯地址。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"<h4>Default Template</h4>\n"
"<p>Uses <a href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/templates/\">Jinja "
"Templating</a> and all the fields of Address (including Custom Fields if "
"any) will be available</p>\n"
"<pre><code>{{ address_line1 }}&lt;br&gt;\n"
"{% if address_line2 %}{{ address_line2 }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{{ city }}&lt;br&gt;\n"
"{% if state %}{{ state }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{% if pincode %} PIN:  {{ pincode }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{{ country }}&lt;br&gt;\n"
"{% if phone %}Phone: {{ phone }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{% if fax %}Fax: {{ fax }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{% if email_id %}Email: {{ email_id }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"</code></pre>"
msgstr ""
"<h4>默认模板</h4>\n"
"<p>使用 <a href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/templates/\">Jinja "
"模板</a>，Address 的所有字段（含自定义字段）均可用</p>\n"
"<pre><code>{{ address_line1 }}&lt;br&gt;\n"
"{% if address_line2 %}{{ address_line2 }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{{ city }}&lt;br&gt;\n"
"{% if state %}{{ state }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{% if pincode %} PIN:  {{ pincode }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{{ country }}&lt;br&gt;\n"
"{% if phone %}Phone: {{ phone }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{% if fax %}Fax: {{ fax }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{% if email_id %}Email: {{ email_id }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"</code></pre>"

