msgstr "关联关系快照"

msgid "Run State"
msgstr "运行状态"

msgid "Step outputs, record aliases and branch choices a resumed run picks up."
msgstr "恢复运行时接着使用的步骤输出、记录别名和分支选择。"

msgid ""
"Tuning for the automation engine: dispatch limits, drain behaviour, "
