msgstr "自动化引擎的调优项：派发上限、消费行为、保留期和负载上限。"

msgid "Disable Automations"
msgstr "停用自动化"

msgid "Stop dispatching automations site-wide. Queued rows are left untouched."
msgstr "全站停止派发自动化。已排队的行保持不动。"

msgid "Maximum Recursion Depth"
msgstr "最大递归深度"

msgid ""
"How many times an automation may trigger another before the chain is "
"refused."
msgstr "一个自动化在被拒绝前可触发另一个自动化的次数。"

msgid "Reliability"
msgstr "可靠性"

msgid "Failure Threshold"
msgstr "失败阈值"

msgid ""
"Consecutive failures after which a flow is auto-disabled and its owner "
"notified."
msgstr "连续失败达到该次数后，流程将自动停用并通知其所有者。"

msgid "Stale Running Minutes"
msgstr "运行超时分钟数"

msgid ""
"How long a claimed row may stay Running before it is assumed crashed and "
"requeued."
msgstr "已认领的行保持“运行中”多久后被判定为崩溃并重新排队。"

msgid "Maximum Attempts"
msgstr "最大尝试次数"

msgid ""
"How many times a claimed row is retried when its run fails outside the "
"flow's own steps, before the row is marked Failed."
msgstr "当运行在流程自身步骤之外失败时，已认领的行在被标记为失败前重试的次数。"

msgid "Drain Seconds"
msgstr "消费秒数"

msgid ""
"Seconds a drain may keep claiming batches. 0 derives it from the queue's "
"own timeout."
msgstr "一次消费可持续认领批次的时间（秒）。0 表示根据队列自身的超时推导。"

msgid "Commit Every"
msgstr "每 N 行提交"

msgid "Rows a drain runs between commits."
msgstr "一次消费在两次提交之间处理的行数。"

msgid "Retention"
msgstr "保留期"

msgid "Queue Retention Days"
msgstr "队列保留天数"

msgid ""
"Days a Failed or Skipped queue row is kept before the nightly sweep "
"removes it."
msgstr "失败或跳过的队列表行在每日清理前保留的天数。"

msgid "Limits"
msgstr "限制"

msgid "Step Output Limit"
msgstr "步骤输出上限"

msgid ""
"Bytes of output a step may publish to later steps. Larger output is "
"dropped, not failed."
msgstr "步骤可向后续步骤发布的输出字节数。超出部分会被丢弃，而不是报错。"

msgid "Event Payload Limit"
msgstr "事件负载上限"

msgid "Bytes an emitted event payload may carry."
msgstr "单一事件负载可携带的字节数。"

msgid "Allow Unregistered Events"
msgstr "允许未注册的事件"

msgid ""
"Accept emit() calls for events no app registered through the "
"automation_events hook."
msgstr "接受对任何未通过 automation_events 钩子注册的事件的 emit() 调用。"

msgid "Triggered At"
msgstr "触发时间"

msgid "Run After"
msgstr "延迟到"

msgid "Null = run as soon as possible. Used by waits and date/cron triggers."
msgstr "空表示尽快运行。用于等待以及日期/cron 触发器。"

msgid "Triggered By"
msgstr "触发者"

msgid "Payload for custom emit() events."
msgstr "自定义 emit() 事件的负载。"

msgid "Wait Resume"
msgstr "等待恢复"

msgid "Resume Run"
msgstr "恢复运行"

msgid "Resume From Step"
msgstr "从某步骤恢复"

msgid "Is Optional"
msgstr "可选"

msgid "Empty State Message"
msgstr "空状态提示"

msgid "Desktop Page"
msgstr "桌面页面"

msgid ""
"Apps shows the hook-driven apps screen. Desktop Icons shows the "
"arrangeable desktop icon grid instead."
msgstr "“应用”显示由钩子驱动的应用界面；“桌面图标”则显示可自由排列的图标网格。"

msgid ""
"The module this workspace belongs to. Decides which module's dock entry "
"and sidebar it appears under."
msgstr "此工作台所属的模块。决定它出现在哪个模块的 Dock 入口和侧边栏下。"

msgid ""
"Archive of the previous navigation. Nothing reads it at runtime; it is "
"kept as the migration's source so the conversion to module sidebars can "
"be run again."
msgstr "旧版导航的存档。运行时不读取，仅作为迁移的来源保留，以便随时重新执行到模块侧边栏的转换。"

msgid ""
"One entry on the dock. `link_type` says what kind of thing it opens, and "
"each kind answers the two questions a click asks -- which page comes up "
"and which shell comes up beside it -- in its own way. A `Sidebar` row "
"*is* the shell: it selects that sidebar and opens its landing route. A "
"`Workspace` row opens a page and derives its shell from the module that "
"owns it. A `URL` row leaves the desk and has no shell at all. Every row "
"also carries its own `icon` and `title`, so the rail reads the way its "
"author wrote it -- blank at an upper layer means inherit. What a row "
"points at *is* its identity, and none of it is stored: re-labelling "
"cannot detach a row from itself, and re-pointing is not an edit but a "
"different row. The same rows at all three layers -- the app's own dock, "
"the site's arrangement and one person's -- told apart by the parent "
"`Dock`, never by the row."
msgstr ""
"Dock 上的一个条目。`link_type` "
"说明它打开的是什么，每种类型以自己的方式回答一次点击的两个问题——显示哪个页面、旁边显示哪个外壳。`Sidebar` "
"行本身就是外壳：它选中该侧边栏并打开其落地路由。`Workspace` 行打开一个页面，并根据拥有它的模块推导外壳。`URL` "
"行会离开桌面，没有外壳。每行还带有自己的 `icon` 和 `title`，因此 Dock "
"的显示与作者所写一致——上层留空表示继承。行指向的对象就是它的身份，且这些都不存储：重新命名不会让行与自身脱离，改变指向也不是编辑，而是另一行。三个层级（应用自身的"
" Dock、站点的编排、个人的编排）使用相同的行，仅通过父级 `Dock` 区分，而不是靠行本身。"

msgid ""
"What kind of thing this entry opens. Spelled the way `Sidebar Item` "
"spells it, so `frappe.ui.sidebar_item.get_route(row)` takes the two page "
"kinds unchanged. `Sidebar` is a value here because a module entry is an "
"entry like any other: it opens the shell, which is the one destination "
"that is not a page."
msgstr ""
"此条目打开的对象类型。拼写方式与 `Sidebar Item` 一致，因此 "
"`frappe.ui.sidebar_item.get_route(row)` 可以不加改动地处理这两种页面类型。此处 `Sidebar` "
"也是一个取值，因为模块条目和其他条目一样：它打开外壳，而外壳是唯一不是页面的目标。"

msgid ""
"The record this entry opens, in the doctype `link_type` names. A "
"`Sidebar` target need not exist as a document: most modules have a "
"computed base and no `Sidebar` row at all, so a row of that kind names a "
"shell rather than referencing one, which is why link validation on a "
"`Dock` is a deliberate no-op."
msgstr ""
"此条目打开的记录，位于 `link_type` 指定的单据类型中。`Sidebar` "
"目标不必真的存在文档：大多数模块使用计算出的基础侧边栏，根本没有 `Sidebar` 行，因此这类行是在命名一个外壳而不是引用一个外壳，这也是 "
"Dock 上的链接校验被有意设为空操作的原因。"

msgid ""
"Where a web address entry goes. A URL row has no shell and is gated by "
"nothing."
msgstr "网址条目的跳转目标。URL 行没有外壳，也不受任何限制。"

msgid ""
"What the rail draws this entry with. Required when the row *adds* an "
"entry, because nothing below it holds one; optional when it references an"
" entry a lower layer already has, where blank means inherit and filled is"
" an override."
msgstr "Dock 绘制此条目所用的图标。当该行“新增”条目时必填，因为其下层没有任何可继承的对象；当它引用下层已有的条目时可空，留空表示继承，填写表示覆盖。"

msgid ""
"How this entry reads on the rail. Required when the row adds and optional"
" when it references, exactly as `icon` is -- and outside the row's "
"identity, so re-labelling can never detach a row from itself."
msgstr "此条目在 Dock 上的显示名称。与 `icon` 相同：新增时必填、引用时可空，且不属于行的身份，因此重新命名绝不会让行与自身脱离。"

msgid ""
"This row *is* the entry, rather than an opinion about one a lower layer "
"holds. Stored rather than inferred from the row carrying a body: under "
"partial opinions a reference may carry an icon and no title, so body-"
"presence stops telling the two apart -- and a reference to a row the app "
"has since deleted would resurrect as a label-less button."
msgstr "该行“就是”这个条目，而不是对下层条目的某种意见。采用存储而非根据行是否带有内容来推断：在部分意见下，引用也可能带有图标而没有标题，于是“是否有内容”无法区分两者；而对应用已删除行的引用会复活成没有标签的按钮。"

msgid ""
"Kept in the row so an explicitly hidden entry stays hidden when its app "
"later adds entries, instead of reappearing because it is simply absent."
msgstr "保存在行中，使显式隐藏的条目在其所属应用之后新增条目时仍保持隐藏，而不是因为不存在而重新出现。"

msgid ""
"A site's overrides on a standard (app-shipped) workspace. Site-owned and "
"standard-only: there is no user layer, deliberately -- a private "
"workspace is already yours to edit directly, and a public one is the "
"site's. The merge is split on purpose. Roles, icon, visibility and "
"sequence are a true diff, so an app's later changes to them keep flowing "
"through. Content is a snapshot, so customizing the layout freezes it "
"against app updates: workspace content is nested editor blocks where "
"headings, paragraphs and spacers carry no key at all, and a delta cannot "
"be written against unkeyed prose. Do not \"fix\" this into one or the "
"other; `reset_workspace_customization` is the escape hatch."
msgstr ""
"站点对标准（应用自带）工作台的覆盖。由站点拥有且仅针对标准工作台：有意不设用户层级——私有工作台本就由你直接编辑，公共工作台则属于站点。合并被有意拆分：角色、图标、可见性和排序是真正的差异合并，因此应用之后对这些项的修改仍会生效；内容则是快照，一旦自定义布局就与应用的更新脱钩，因为工作台内容是由编辑器区块嵌套而成，其中标题、段落和间隔块根本没有键，无法对无键的文本写出增量。不要把它“修正”成两者之一；`reset_workspace_customization`"
" 是兜底手段。"

msgid ""
"Override whether the standard workspace is shown. \"Inherit\" keeps the "
"app-shipped value."
msgstr "覆盖是否显示标准工作台。“继承”保留应用自带的值。"

msgid "Inherit"
msgstr "继承"

msgid "Visible"
msgstr "可见"

msgid "Added Roles"
msgstr "增加的角色"

msgid "Roles granted access on top of the app-shipped roles."
msgstr "在应用自带角色之外额外授予访问权的角色。"

msgid "Removed Roles"
msgstr "移除的角色"

msgid "App-shipped roles whose access is revoked on this site."
msgstr "在本站点撤销访问权的应用自带角色。"

msgid "Leave blank to inherit the app-shipped icon."
msgstr "留空则继承应用自带的图标。"

msgid "Leave blank to inherit the app-shipped color."
msgstr "留空则继承应用自带的颜色。"

msgid "Override Sidebar Position"
msgstr "覆盖侧边栏位置"

msgid "Sidebar Position"
msgstr "侧边栏位置"

msgid ""
"The site's editor.js block layout for this workspace, shown verbatim. "
"Once set, the app's later changes to this workspace's layout stop "
"reaching the site; roles, icon and visibility keep updating. Managed by "
"the workspace editor."
msgstr ""
"此工作台在本站点的 editor.js "
"区块布局，按原样显示。一旦设置，应用之后对该工作台布局的修改将不再生效；角色、图标和可见性仍会继续更新。由工作台编辑器管理。"

msgid "Added Widgets"
msgstr "增加的组件"

msgid ""
"Item definitions (shortcuts / charts / cards ...) backing blocks the site"
" added, so they can be rendered. Managed by the workspace editor."
msgstr "支撑站点新增区块的条目定义（快捷方式 / 图表 / 卡片等），以便渲染。由工作台编辑器管理。"

msgid "Route Signature"
msgstr "路由标识"

msgid "Layout Order"
msgstr "布局顺序"

msgid "Set this to decide which position a layout appears in the dropdown"
msgstr "设置此项以决定该布局在下拉列表中的位置"

msgid ""
"The module this sidebar belongs to. Neither required nor unique: one "
"module may own several sidebars, and which of them answers for the module"
" itself is decided by the name -- the one called after the module -- "
"rather than by a column here. May also be blank, which means the sidebar "
"belongs to its app rather than to any one of the app's modules; such a "
"sidebar is exported to the app's own folder and says which app in `app`."
msgstr ""
"此侧边栏所属的模块。既非必填也非唯一：一个模块可以拥有多个侧边栏，其中哪个代表模块本身由名称决定——即与模块同名的那一个——而不是由此处的某个字段决定。也可以留空，表示该侧边栏属于其应用而不是应用的某个模块；此类侧边栏会导出到应用自己的目录，并通过"
" `app` 字段说明所属应用。"

msgid ""
"What this sidebar is called, on screen and as its record name (`autoname:"
" field:title`). Defaults to the module's name, and the default is stored "
"-- so a module's own sidebar keeps the name it has always had, and a "
"second sidebar under that module is told apart by being called something "
"else. `unique` on top of that adds one thing the primary key does not: it"
" refuses a second sidebar claiming the title of a row whose name has "
"drifted away from it -- a legacy row, or one written straight to the "
"table."
msgstr ""
"此侧边栏的名称，用于显示，也作为记录名（`autoname: "
"field:title`）。默认为模块名称，且该默认值会被存储——因此模块自带的侧边栏保持其一直使用的名称，而同一模块下的第二个侧边栏通过取其他名称来区分。在此基础上再加"
" `unique` "
"还能做到主键做不到的一点：拒绝第二个声称使用了某一行的标题、而该行的名称已与其不一致的侧边栏——例如遗留行，或直接写入数据表的行。"

msgid ""
"The app this sidebar is placed in. Derived from the module when there is "
"one -- a module sits in exactly one app. Author-set when there is not: an"
" app-rooted sidebar has no module to derive it from, and this is then the"
" only thing that says which app ships the file."
msgstr "此侧边栏所在的应用。有模块时由模块推导——一个模块只属于一个应用。没有模块时由作者指定：以应用为根的侧边栏没有模块可推导，此时这是唯一说明由哪个应用发布该文件的信息。"

msgid ""
"Owned by an app: exported to its module's folder -- or to the app's own "
"folder when it has no module -- and re-imported by migrate. Set via the "
"Mark as Standard action, not by hand -- a standard sidebar with no "
"exported file is an orphan and gets deleted on the next migrate. "
"Everything else belongs to this site, however it got here."
msgstr ""
"由应用拥有：导出到其模块目录——无模块时导出到应用自己的目录——并在 migrate "
"时重新导入。应通过“标记为标准”操作设置，而不要手工设置——没有导出文件的标准侧边栏属于孤儿，会在下次 migrate "
"时被删除。除此之外的一切都属于本站点，无论它是如何到这里来的。"

msgid "Merged From"
msgstr "合并来源"

msgid ""
"Workspaces whose sidebars were merged to build this one. Read by the "
"module-split tool."
msgstr "为构建此侧边栏而合并的其侧边栏的工作台。由模块拆分工具读取。"

msgid ""
"Fields shown on each card, in order. Set an Icon to show it on the card "
"(label on hover); leave Icon empty to show the Label text. Leave the "
"table empty to auto-pick."
msgstr "每张卡片上按顺序显示的字段。设置图标则卡片上显示图标（悬停显示标签）；图标留空则直接显示标签文本。表格留空则自动选择。"

msgid ""
"Fields shown in the card hover preview, in order. Icon and Label behave "
"the same as Card Fields. Leave empty to use the doctype's preview fields,"
" then card fields."
msgstr "卡片悬停预览中按顺序显示的字段。图标和标签的行为与“卡片字段”相同。留空则使用单据类型的预览字段，其次使用卡片字段。"

msgid ""
"Fields the board can group cards by (swimlanes). New boards are pre-"
"filled with the doctype's Select fields (except the column field). Add "
"Link fields to offer more groupings; leave empty to hide the Group "
"button."
msgstr ""
"看板可将卡片分组的字段（泳道）。新建看板会预填该单据类型的 Select 字段（分列字段除外）。可添加 Link "
"字段以提供更多分组；留空则隐藏“分组”按钮。"

msgid "Use Kanban v2 (New Experience)"
msgstr "使用看板 v2（新体验）"

msgid ""
"Open this board in the new Kanban experience. When off, the classic "
"Kanban is used. Same List / Kanban route either way."
msgstr "在新版看板体验中打开此看板。关闭时使用经典看板。两种方式的列表/看板路由相同。"

msgid "New Kanban"
msgstr "新看板"

msgid "Layout and fields used by the new Kanban experience for this board."
msgstr "此看板在新版看板体验中使用的布局和字段。"

msgid "Field shown as the card title: ID or a text field."
msgstr "作为卡片标题显示的字段：ID 或文本字段。"

msgid ""
"Show the assignee stack and Assign control on cards and in the hover "
"preview."
msgstr "在卡片和悬停预览中显示指派人叠层和指派控件。"

msgid ""
"Show document tags on cards (left of footer date), using the standard "
"colored tag style."
msgstr "在卡片上显示单据标签（位于页脚日期左侧），使用标准的彩色标签样式。"

msgid "Attach Image field shown as a thumbnail before the card title."
msgstr "作为卡片标题前缩略图显示的“附加图片”字段。"

msgid "Modified"
msgstr "修改时间"

msgid "Card and Preview Fields"
msgstr "卡片与预览字段"

msgid "Complete Onboarding"
msgstr "完成引导"

msgid "Field of the board's reference doctype to show on the card."
msgstr "看板的引用单据类型中要显示在卡片上的字段。"

msgid ""
"Optional. When set, the card shows this icon and the label on hover; when"
" empty, the label is shown directly."
msgstr "可选。设置后卡片显示该图标、悬停显示标签；留空则直接显示标签。"

msgid ""
"Shown as the field label, or as the icon tooltip when an icon is set. "
"Auto-filled from the field; edit to override."
msgstr "作为字段标签显示，或在设置图标时作为图标提示。由字段自动填充；可编辑覆盖。"

msgid ""
"Allow editing even if the doctype has a workflow set up.\n"
"\n"
"Does nothing if a workflow isn't set up."
msgstr ""
"即使单据类型配置了工作流也允许编辑。\n"
"\n"
"未配置工作流时此设置无效。"

msgid ""
"Sidebar intent for a module, at either of the two layers a site has. "
"`user` is what tells them apart: blank is the site layer, curated by a "
"Workspace Manager and applying to everyone; a user's name is that "
"person's own arrangement, which is applied on top and wins. The `Custom "
"*` prefix elsewhere in this repo means site-owned override of app-shipped"
" content, and this doctype knowingly overloads it: with the layers "
"structurally identical there is nothing to gain from a second doctype, "
"and `user` makes the layer unambiguous at a glance. Do not \"fix\" this "
"by splitting it."
msgstr ""
"模块的侧边栏意图，位于站点具有的两个层级之一。`user` "
"用于区分二者：留空为站点层，由工作台管理员维护并适用于所有人；填写用户名则是该人自己的编排，叠加在上并优先生效。本仓库其他地方的 `Custom "
"*` 前缀表示站点对应用自带内容的覆盖，而此单据类型有意复用了它：既然两个层级结构完全相同，再拆一个单据类型毫无收益，而 `user` "
"让人一眼就能看出层级。不要把它“修正”成拆分的做法。"

msgid ""
"Blank means the site layer, which applies to everyone and is overridden "
"by each user's own arrangement."
msgstr "留空表示站点层，适用于所有人，并会被每个用户自己的编排覆盖。"

msgid "Overrides the dock label for this module."
msgstr "覆盖该模块的 Dock 显示名称。"

msgid ""
"One ordered list holding both references to base items (`added` unset -- "
"non-empty fields override, empty fields mean no opinion) and items this "
"layer added (`added` set -- full items, rendered as they stand). Row "
"order is the arrangement; base items not named here keep their base order"
" and follow the ones that are, which is how a newly installed app's items"
" still reach someone who has already reordered."
msgstr ""
"一个有序列表，同时保存对基础条目的引用（`added` 未设置——非空字段表示覆盖，空字段表示无意见）和本层新增的条目（`added` "
"已设置——完整条目，按原样渲染）。行顺序就是编排；此处未列出的基础条目保持其基础顺序并排在这些条目之后，因此新安装应用的条目仍能到达已经重新排序过的用户。"

msgid ""
"One layer of one app's dock. Three of them share this table, told apart "
"by `app`, `user` and `standard`: the app's own dock, which an app ships "
"as an exported document and a developer authors; the site's arrangement "
"of it, curated by a Workspace Manager and applying to everyone; and one "
"person's own, applied last and winning. A dock belongs to an app, so "
"arranging ERPNext's rail does not touch frappe's -- and a layer is "
"addressed by app plus user rather than by user alone. Same shape at all "
"three, because the rows are identical and the parent is what says whose "
"they are; see `Custom Sidebar`, which layers a sidebar the same way in a "
"table of its own."
msgstr ""
"某个应用 Dock 的一个层级。三个层级共用这张表，通过 `app`、`user` 和 `standard` 区分：应用自身的 "
"Dock（应用以导出文档形式发布，由开发者编写）、站点对它的编排（由工作台管理员维护并适用于所有人）、以及个人自己的编排（最后应用并优先生效）。Dock"
" 属于应用，因此编排 ERPNext 的 Dock 不会影响 frappe "
"的——层级通过应用加用户来定位，而不是只靠用户。三者结构相同，因为行是完全一样的，而父级决定了它们属于谁；参见 `Custom "
"Sidebar`，它以同样的方式在自己的表中分层侧边栏。"

msgid ""
"The app whose dock this layer arranges. Required: a dock belongs to an "
"app, and a layer that named none would be one arrangement spanning every "
"rail. An `Autocomplete` over installed apps rather than a Link, because "
"there is no `App` doctype -- the house spelling, shared with "
"`Sidebar.app` and `Desktop Icon.app`."
msgstr ""
"此层所编排 Dock 所属的应用。必填：Dock 属于应用，未指定应用的层将成为横跨所有 Dock 的一套编排。此处使用基于已安装应用的 "
"`Autocomplete` 而不是 Link，因为并不存在 `App` 单据类型——这是本仓库的既定写法，与 `Sidebar.app` 和 "
"`Desktop Icon.app` 一致。"

msgid ""
"The person whose own arrangement this is. Blank means the app's own dock "
"or the site's arrangement of it, told apart by `standard`."
msgstr "此编排所属的用户。留空表示应用自身的 Dock 或站点对它的编排，由 `standard` 区分。"

msgid ""
"Owned by the app: exported to `<app>/dock/<app>/<app>.json` and re-"
"imported by migrate. This is the app layer, and the layer the other two "
"are laid over. Ordinarily set via the Export to App action rather than by"
" hand, which is why it is writable only in developer mode -- a standard "
"dock with no exported file is an orphan and gets deleted on the next "
"migrate."
msgstr ""
"由应用拥有：导出到 `<app>/dock/<app>/<app>.json`，并在 migrate "
"时重新导入。这是应用层，也是另外两层叠加其上的基础层。通常通过“导出到应用”操作设置而非手工设置，因此只在开发者模式下可写——没有导出文件的标准 "
"Dock 属于孤儿，会在下次 migrate 时被删除。"

msgid "Mount On"
msgstr "挂载到"

msgid ""
"The app this one mounts on, for a companion app -- one with no rail of "
"its own, whose entries live on a host's. Blank on every ordinary dock. An"
" **app name** rather than a Link to a `Dock`: every consumer wants a "
"string, and a pin aimed at a record would be a pin aimed at one of that "
"app's three layers, which means nothing. App-layer only: `depends_on` "
"hides it elsewhere and `validate` blanks it, because hiding a field does "
"not stop an API write."
msgstr ""
"此应用挂载到哪个应用，用于伴随应用——即自身没有 Dock、其条目位于宿主应用上的应用。普通 Dock 中留空。此处是**应用名称**而不是指向 "
"`Dock` 的 "
"Link：所有使用方都需要字符串，而指向记录的引用会指向该应用三个层级中的某一个，毫无意义。仅应用层使用：`depends_on` "
"会在其他位置隐藏它，`validate` 会将其置空，因为隐藏字段并不能阻止 API 写入。"

msgid "Dock Items"
msgstr "Dock 条目"

msgid ""
"The ordered entries this layer has an opinion about. Row order is the "
"arrangement; an entry this layer never names keeps its incoming order and"
" follows the ones it does, which is how a newly installed app's modules "
"still reach someone who has already arranged their dock."
msgstr "本层有意见的有序条目。行顺序就是编排；本层从未提及的条目保持其传入顺序并排在这些条目之后，因此新安装应用的模块仍能到达已经编排过 Dock 的用户。"

msgid "Is Default Module"
msgstr "是默认模块"

msgid ""
"This module is the linked entity's default home — where it opens when "
"nothing else decides — even when another app defines it. A sidebar that "
"already lists the entity still holds you, so this settles cold entry "
"rather than overriding where you are. Flag what you mean to own: a claim "
"is declarative, so set it on the entities your app is about rather than "
"only where you expect the default to disagree with you. Only an app-"
"shipped sidebar may claim."
msgstr "此模块是所关联实体的默认主页——当没有其他依据时就在这里打开——即使它是由另一个应用定义的。已经列出该实体的侧边栏仍会留住用户，因此这里解决的是冷启动入口，而不是覆盖用户当前的所在位置。只标记你确实想拥有的实体：声明是主张性的，因此请把它设在你的应用所针对的实体上，而不是只设在你预计默认值会与你不一致的地方。只有应用自带的侧边栏才能声明。"

msgid ""
"Only meaningful on a `Custom Sidebar`, where a row is either a reference "
"to a base item or an item the site or the user added."
msgstr "仅在 `Custom Sidebar` 上有意义：其中的行要么引用基础条目，要么是站点或用户新增的条目。"

msgid ""
"Hide this item. Explicit rather than implied by the row's presence, which"
" is what lets a user's `hidden: 0` un-hide something the site hid."
msgstr "隐藏此条目。是显式设置而非由行的存在推断，这样用户的 `hidden: 0` 才能取消站点所做的隐藏。"

msgid ""
"0 means this row references a base item: non-empty fields override it, "
"empty fields mean no opinion. 1 means a full item the layer added, "
"rendered as it stands."
msgstr "0 表示此行引用基础条目：非空字段覆盖它，空字段表示无意见。1 表示这是本层新增的完整条目，按原样渲染。"

msgid ""
"Only meaningful on a `Custom Sidebar` row referring to a base item that "
"has no link -- a Section Break or a spacer -- which is the one kind of "
"row with nothing else to name it by. A base row stores none: an unlinked "
"one is identified by a hash of its type and label, and a linked one by "
"its own link columns, which is what lets a rename repair the base row and"
" the customization naming it together."
msgstr ""
"仅在引用无链接基础条目（分区标题或间隔块）的 `Custom Sidebar` "
"行上有意义——这是唯一没有其他字段可标识自身的行类型。基础行不存储该值：无链接的基础行通过其类型与标签的哈希标识，有链接的通过其自身的链接列标识，这样才能让重命名同时修复基础行和引用它的自定义行。"

msgid ""
"Enable if on click\n"
"opens modal."
msgstr "勾选后，点击将打开弹窗。"

msgid ""
"Select or Link field of the board's reference doctype to group cards by "
"(swimlanes)."
msgstr "看板引用单据类型中用于将卡片分组的 Select 或 Link 字段（泳道）。"

msgid ""
"Shown as the group option's name. Auto-filled from the field; edit to "
"override."
msgstr "作为分组选项的名称显示。由字段自动填充；可编辑覆盖。"

msgid "Overdue Limit"
msgstr "逾期限额"

msgid ""
"New Sales Invoices are blocked when the customer's overdue amount exceeds"
" this. Requires 'Restrict Customer Over Billing' in Accounts Settings."
msgstr "当客户的逾期金额超过此值时，将无法新建销售发票。需在“会计设置”中启用“限制客户超额开票”。"

msgid ""
"Blocks new transactions and further accounting entries on this customer's"
" account. Only users with the role set in Company's \"Roles Allowed to "
"Set and Edit Frozen Account Entries\" can transact."
msgstr "冻结客户账户上的新交易和后续会计分账。只有拥有“公司”中“允许设置和编辑冻结账户分录的角色”所设角色的用户才能进行交易。"

msgid "Credit & Overdue Limits"
msgstr "信用与逾期限额"

msgid ""
"Transactions are blocked when the outstanding balance exceeds the credit "
"limit. When Restrict Customer Over Billing is enabled, new invoices are "
"also blocked when the customer's overdue amount exceeds the Overdue "
"Limit."
msgstr "当未结余额超过信用额度时，交易将被阻止。启用“限制客户超额开票”后，当客户的逾期金额超过逾期限额时，新的发票也会被阻止。"

msgid ""
"Frozen suppliers block new transactions and ledger entries until "
"unfrozen. Only users with the role set in Company's \"Roles Allowed to "
"Set and Edit Frozen Account Entries\" can transact."
msgstr "冻结的供应商会阻止新的交易和账簿分录，直到解除冻结。只有拥有“公司”中“允许设置和编辑冻结账户分录的角色”所设角色的用户才能进行交易。"

msgid "Rate at which document currency is converted to company currency"
msgstr "单据币种折算为公司币种的汇率"

msgid "Rate at which Price List Currency is converted to Company Currency"
msgstr "价格表币种折算为公司币种的汇率"

msgid "Valuation Type"
msgstr "计价方式"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Valuation Rate and Manual value this item on its own and deduct that cost"
" from the raw material cost, like the pre-v16 scrap items. % of Component"
" Cost allocates a percentage of the remaining raw material cost."
msgstr ""
"“计价单价”和“手动”会单独为该物料计价，并从原材料成本中扣减该成本，与 v16 "
"之前的废料处理一致。“组件成本百分比”则按比例分摊剩余的原材料成本。"

#, python-format
msgid "% of Component Cost"
msgstr "组件成本百分比"

msgid "On hold"
msgstr "暂挂"

msgid "Auto Map Raw Materials to Finished Goods"
msgstr "自动将原材料对应到成品"

msgid ""
"On submit of a Manufacture / Repack entry, map the raw material serial / "
